The ModelShot name, the logo mark (every variant in logo/ and the icons in public/), the hero illustration in
illustrations/ and the social preview image are our own work. They are not covered by the MIT licence of this
repository (the LICENSE file at the repository root, which covers the code and the documentation). The same holds for
the artwork that the generator sources draw (../src/logo/markSvg.ts, ../src/illustration/heroIslandSvg.ts and
../social/social-preview.html with its stylesheet): the code of those files is MIT, the marks and images they produce are
not. In this note, "the brand assets" means all of the above.

Permission for forks and redistributions. You may keep the brand assets, unchanged, in a fork or a redistribution of
this repository, and in what it builds without changes to them, as long as all of the following hold:

1. The files stay as they are: not modified, cropped, recoloured, merged into other artwork or regenerated with
   changed generator code.
2. They stay part of the repository: you do not use them on their own, outside a copy of this repository and what it
   builds.
3. They do not identify anything other than ModelShot: you do not use the name or the brand assets to name, brand or
   advertise a different product, service or project, and not in a way that suggests ModelShot or the holder made,
   endorses or supports your fork. A fork that you publish, deploy or distribute as your own product or service, or
   under another name, replaces the brand assets with its own.
4. In a copy of the repository this file stays next to them. A build may carry them where the unchanged build
   configuration of this repository places them (for example the icons and the social preview copied from public/ to
   the build root, or the logo inlined into a page), without this file.

Any other use, copy, modification or distribution of the brand assets needs written permission from the holder.
Nominative references to ModelShot as a project, such as a link or a mention in text, need no permission. The
permission above gives no right in the ModelShot name or marks beyond what it states, and it ends for anyone who breaks
its conditions.

The fonts are not covered by this note: they live in ../fonts/<family>/ with their SIL Open Font License (OFL.txt).
